WEBVTT

00:00:00.139 --> 00:00:04.846
Custom functions reshape a value.

00:00:04.846 --> 00:00:09.814
Open the Developer Console and sign in with your console token.

00:00:09.814 --> 00:00:16.616
Open an integration and go to Output.

00:00:16.616 --> 00:00:18.412
On a field, set Transform to Custom function.

00:00:18.412 --> 00:00:22.298
Choose New function.

00:00:22.298 --> 00:00:26.382
Write the function: data is this field's value.

00:00:26.382 --> 00:00:32.244
Test with a sample value.

00:00:32.244 --> 00:00:35.008
Save. The function is stored in your workspace transforms folder.

00:00:35.008 --> 00:00:47.193
Now test the integration to see the function applied.

00:00:47.193 --> 00:00:49.724
There is also a post-process hook on the whole output. Close without saving the integration.

00:00:51.301 --> 00:00:58.518
The function is saved as plain files.
